  "rewrites": {
   "8": {
    "original": "Dr. Johnson is overseeing PhD student Zachary Shively, pre-doc intern Yan Lin, and postdocs Jiafei Wang and Valerie Ayres in projects designed to facilitate genetic engineering and genomics projects in wheat using a number of engineering and genomics technologies available in the lab at the International Wheat Genome Sequencing Consortium/SciLifeLab facility in Uppsala, Sweden.",
    "rewrite": "Under Dr. Johnson\u2019s supervision, the PhD student Zachary Shively, pre-doctoral intern Yan Lin, along with postdoctoral researchers Jiafei Wang and Valerie Ayres, are working on projects aimed at facilitating genetic engineering and genomics endeavors in wheat through a range of engineering and genomics tools available at the International Wheat Genome Sequencing Consortium/SciLifeLab facility in Uppsala, Sweden."
   },
